title: 'It held again: Ed''s second dream, 2026-11-15, wrote every note into a place the first had made, and Libby moved only one of them.'
pid: 7d108d0c-cc1c-49ce-a33a-b64a7d813ce1
body: |2-
  The reading of Grudin went into the case note, behind the first link
  of "what I know"; the new action into the action subgraph; the
  letters into "from a dream, to the others"; Gen's two verdicts under
  the findings they judge. The dreamer gave the reason: it arrived in
  about six requests, since the mission said to read only the team's
  titles and the graph already had a place for what it found. Libby
  put one reading of history, ZOG and KMS, behind a link where it
  stood. Two cases, both of a graph that had its places.
